                <pb facs="1433" n="1275" xml:id="pg1275"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Meyer to
                        the Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">St.
                                Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-01-04"><hi rendition="#italic">January 4,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Following telegram, dated January 3, just received from consulate, Warsaw:
                    “Workmen’s union ordered resumption work; factories reopening; extreme
                    socialists’ influence weakened; no great trouble anticipated.”</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Meyer.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
